        "chapter": 9,
        "verse": 6
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "REV",
          "chapter": 9,
          "verse": 6
        }
      ],
      "en": "In those days people will seek death, and will in no way find it. They will desire to die, and death will flee from them.",
      "ko": "그날에는 사람들이 죽기를 구하여도 얻지 못하고 죽고 싶으나 죽음이 저희를 피하리로다",
      "source_text_hash": "e3ebcd853015fac566777cead9ec66136aeadc2bfac763f41ecc8fb1d2e01c4e",
      "translation_text_hash": "f3e54e00a2882251f1724714810352061f93b0f2c7f142a96d0189c719a10144",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "그날에는 사람들이 죽기를 구하여도 얻지 못하고 죽고 싶으나 죽음이 저희를 피하리로다"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "f3e54e00a2882251f1724714810352061f93b0f2c7f142a96d0189c719a10144"
      ]
