      "en": "By these three plagues, one third of mankind was killed: by the fire, the smoke, and the sulfur, which proceeded out of their mouths.",
      "ko": "이 세 재앙 곧 저희 입에서 나오는 불과 연기와 유황을 인하여 사람 삼분의 일이 죽임을 당하니라",
      "source_text_hash": "151d149de952cf4a83f105bffd5c06a3ecf04be655ad4f107d71adcaa430223d",
      "translation_text_hash": "36a3cbaac934e9d294528f8c48cbc07914f1520e8448eb57e7fcb9fe1baed22f",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
